Adds the sinker EDM sections to the EDM operations page: the machine,
electrode, conditions, orbits and post status, each kind's settings by
tab with seed defaults read from source, and the refusals quoted from
source. Updates the page title, the operations.md table and link text,
and the stale sinker sentence and kind row in machines.md.

